  (text "J1: WAVESHARE ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-2.8B J7 (2x12, 2.54 mm). 11 GPIO0, 13 GPIO4 (R24 lifted), 17/19 I2C SCL/SDA (GPIO7/15), 18 GPIO43, 20 GPIO44"
    (at 20.32 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid 26baf706-d96b-472b-b501-52dab3edd962)
  )
  (text "Hand-soldered. Stack-up mirrors the pin rows: check against the Waveshare STEP at layout."
    (at 20.32 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 7eff327e-3166-4d25-9efb-cc9fae2618e2)
  )
  (text "FAN INTERFACE - FAN DOMAIN (GND_F). Fail-off, isolated (SR-08, SR-09, D-023, D-054; interfaces §2.1). >= 3 mm to node copper (pcb/SAFETY.md)"
    (at 30.48 115.57 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid a0bb7996-bfc7-4a4d-891c-de94dffd6571)
  )
  (text "J-FAN = J2 + J7: J2.1 GND (BLK), J2.2 +10V (RED), J7.1 SPD (YEL), J7.2 TACH (WHT)"
    (at 30.48 175.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 28bafd26-5db3-499d-821a-804d94ea6ae8)
  )
  (text "J-OCC: 24 VAC lighting signal (FR-07, interfaces §2.2) - OCC field domain"
    (at 30.48 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid 89db7c31-dd68-4ea4-b480-db34d9c0558e)
  )
  (text "SEN65 (D-012) on +3V3. Shares the Waveshare I2C bus; its pull-ups are on that board, so ours are DNP pads (D-054)"
    (at 190.5 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid b42d6a50-58b4-419e-9d37-6ba6e7847454)
  )
  (text "INDICATOR: 6 x SK6812SIDE-A on the carrier's room-side edge (D-055, FR-15). GPIO0 -> 2N7002 inverter (RMT invert_out). 10k gate pull-up keeps GPIO0 high at reset (normal boot) and DIN low. Firmware caps LED current at 300 mA"
    (at 30.48 275.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid c3aa5330-e315-47df-a637-f04581260de0)
  )

